= The ban is lifted

The ban on the KPD ends on 1 March 1924. The party's papers come back, the offices reopen, and the cell structure built in the winter is kept alongside the legal organisation. The election campaign for May has begun, and the party enters it as a martyr of the Republic, which gives it a vote that no programme could win.

